{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的大块保留了每屏的因果、转折和人物处境，单看大字也能串起故事；Y 只看加亮词时，部分屏幕容易变成几个意思相关但关系不够清楚的短语。small：Y 的小字补充心理关系更有价值，例如“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”“那一刻的轻松是真的，却没带来答案”，比 X 较多重复主要情绪的感官比喻更有补充性；core：平，两版都清楚呈现了不愿再受委屈与舍不得旧日亲近、归属之间的反复拉扯，最后也都落在带着想念继续生活。concise：X 的感受文字明显更收敛，Y 有不少较长的音乐分析和相近意思的反复解释；human：X 整体更接近日常表达，Y 的“活动感像暂时侧身离开沉重的问题”中“活动感”的搭配生硬，“近似圣咏的庄严里藏着秘密念头”也偏抽象书面；fine：X 更集中写观众当下的身体感受，如胸口发紧、脚下发飘、暖意散尽，Y 则经常转向和弦、旋律等音乐本身；load：Y 的加亮词短而精简，尤其 S08、S10、S11、S12，短时间内更容易扫完，X 的整块大字虽然信息完整，但短屏上阅读负担较重。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0eddba3f-9db4-49e0-bd54-d273f9d15019", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T213607130797Z", "elapsed_seconds": 183.86, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T21:39:10.991096+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b635fb6029c359e7fff3ea49c41b7b1ace88aa9c74243a044e18f2854e05b6f8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_